diff --git a/unreleased_changes/10330.md b/unreleased_changes/10330.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..8ffe190669c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unreleased_changes/10330.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+### Fixed
+- Fixed that dragging an edge of a bounding box that is small on screen (e.g. when zoomed out) often resized a corner instead, changing the box's height or width unintentionally.
+- Fixed that a bounding box edge jumped to the mouse position when starting to resize it.
